Pinball Controller -- licensing
===============================

This repository contains two kinds of work under two licences.

1. Hardware design -- Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
   (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

   Applies to: everything in model/, print/, images/ and docs/.

   If you share or remix it, credit this project and keep the same
   licence.

2. Software -- MIT License (see LICENSE-CODE)

   Applies to: everything in status-display/, tools/, renders/, pc/ and
   firmware/pinscape_config.json, except the third-party parts below.

Third-party software
--------------------

- firmware/zedmd-v5.1.8-pinball.patch, firmware/attract_fx.h and
  firmware/attract_text.h modify and are compiled into ZeDMD
  (https://github.com/PPUC/ZeDMD, GPL-2.0, (c) the PPUC team). They are
  distributed under the GPL-2.0.
- The marquee service loads libzedmd (https://github.com/PPUC/libzedmd,
  GPL-3.0) at run time; it is not included here.
- Pinscape Pico (https://github.com/mjrgh/PinscapePico, (c) Michael J
  Roberts, BSD-style licence) is downloaded from its own releases; only
  a configuration file for it is included here.
